{"items":[{"id":"1572214096954662912","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-80dc1312e5c96b7d113fe9d302f31d7d_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"876\" height=\"1112\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":147,"commentCount":11,"created":1667625051,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1572214096954662912"},{"id":"1570864840289214464","title":"说下供销社的事情吧","content":"<p>说下供销社的事情吧。&lt;br&gt;就是大家看口径像是农业，但其实供销社的问题只有一个：&lt;br&gt;它太容易被做成税收了。&lt;br&gt;低价收，高价卖，里面的利润拿来缴税。&lt;br&gt;这才是真正需要担忧的地方。</p>","excerpt":"说下供销社的事情吧","voteupCount":211,"commentCount":20,"created":1667303363,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1570864840289214464"},{"id":"1570382695317827584","title":"兄弟们，能不能关注并推荐我的下公号“多…","content":"<p>兄弟们，能不能关注并推荐我的下公号“多鱼说”啊，同样的文章，阅读还没知乎赞多，属实是太惨了。</p><img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-b6144a21b31485ca46a625b2bb699169_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"550\" height=\"556\">","excerpt":"兄弟们，能不能关注并推荐我的下公号“多…","voteupCount":124,"commentCount":18,"created":1667188410,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1570382695317827584"},{"id":"1569657652770213888","title":"在推特这个事上，知乎的朋友在关心川普会…","content":"<p>在推特这个事上，知乎的朋友在关心川普会不会回来，群里的朋友在担心会不会扫黄……&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;真的离谱</p>","excerpt":"在推特这个事上，知乎的朋友在关心川普会…","voteupCount":109,"commentCount":13,"created":1667015547,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1569657652770213888"},{"id":"1569073684962390016","title":"绷","content":"<p>绷</p><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-4ffb9ce9e0e16f988065fb833ab1b49a_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1070\" height=\"1063\">","excerpt":"绷","voteupCount":280,"commentCount":24,"created":1666876318,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1569073684962390016"},{"id":"1567934202770882560","title":"公众号“多鱼说”开始正常更新了，大家可…","content":"<p>公众号“多鱼说”开始正常更新了，大家可以去关注一些，前些时候被知乎删的回答也都放在公号了。</p><img src=\"https://pic3.zhimg.com/50/v2-14c32a2dd72972f8aa1b8a4c2367bcb2_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1078\" height=\"520\">","excerpt":"公众号“多鱼说”开始正常更新了，大家可…","voteupCount":100,"commentCount":6,"created":1666604644,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1567934202770882560"},{"id":"1567892107704123392","title":"不要扯什么珍惜2900的大盘，珍惜3字头的…","content":"<p>不要扯什么珍惜2900的大盘，珍惜3字头的平安了。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;你们能不能珍惜一下我</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-664484e5b60cc185454e130456bd19eb_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"225\" height=\"225\">","excerpt":"不要扯什么珍惜2900的大盘，珍惜3字头的…","voteupCount":110,"commentCount":13,"created":1666594608,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1567892107704123392"},{"id":"1567624695272439808","title":"加群发现一个事，之前的2个大群都在说投…","content":"<p>加群发现一个事，之前的2个大群都在说投资，现在的群都在搞黄色。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;也挺好，只要不键政我们都是好朋友</p>","excerpt":"加群发现一个事，之前的2个大群都在说投…","voteupCount":133,"commentCount":8,"created":1666530852,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1567624695272439808"},{"id":"1566935134787530752","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-cab19030e87f2c77b218ffdd72dc933b_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"1400\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":284,"commentCount":64,"created":1666366448,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1566935134787530752"},{"id":"1566537319980728320","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-e6ea4a8cc2aba257c8beaf43be32b8aa_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1239\" height=\"1080\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":351,"commentCount":26,"created":1666271601,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1566537319980728320"}]}